      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "<color=#F7BE45>[PARENT_CHARACTER1]</color>(이)가 <color=#F7BE45>[CHARACTER_NAME]</color>의 여정에 동료로 합류하게 되었다!",
      "UnitTalk_ENG": "<color=#F7BE45>[PARENT_CHARACTER1]</color> has joined <color=#F7BE45>[CHARACTER_NAME]</color>'s Journey as a companion!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "<color=#F7BE45>[PARENT_CHARACTER1]</color>が<color=#F7BE45>[CHARACTER_NAME]</color>の旅の仲間に加わった！",
      "UnitTalk_CHN": "<color=#F7BE45>[PARENT_CHARACTER1]</color>以伙伴身分加入了<color=#F7BE45>[CHARACTER_NAME]</color>的旅程！",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "<color=#F7BE45>[PARENT_CHARACTER1]</color>以夥伴身分加入了<color=#F7BE45>[CHARACTER_NAME]</color>的旅程！",
      "UnitTalk_FRA": "<color=#F7BE45>[PARENT_CHARACTER1]</color> a rejoint Le Périple de <color=#F7BE45>[CHARACTER_NAME]</color> en tant que compagnon !",
      "UnitTalk_DEU": "<color=#F7BE45>[PARENT_CHARACTER1]</color> ist <color=#F7BE45>[CHARACTER_NAME]</color>s Reise als Begleiter beigetreten!",
      "UnitTalk_ESP": "¡<color=#F7BE45>[PARENT_CHARACTER1]</color> se ha unido a La Travesía de <color=#F7BE45>[CHARACTER_NAME]</color> como compañero!",
      "UnitTalk_PRT": "<color=#F7BE45>[PARENT_CHARACTER1]</color> juntou-se à jornada de <color=#F7BE45>[CHARACTER_NAME]</color> como companheiro!",
      "UnitTalk_THA": "<color=#F7BE45>[PARENT_CHARACTER1]</color> ได้เข้าร่วมการเดินทางของ <color=#F7BE45>[CHARACTER_NAME]</color> ในฐานะสหายแล้ว!",
      "UnitTalk_IND": "<color=#F7BE45>[PARENT_CHARACTER1]</color> telah bergabung dalam Perjalanan <color=#F7BE45>[CHARACTER_NAME]</color> sebagai pendamping!",
      "UnitTalk_VIE": "<color=#F7BE45>[PARENT_CHARACTER1]</color> đã tham gia hành trình của <color=#F7BE45>[CHARACTER_NAME]</color> với tư cách là đồng đội!",
      "UnitTalk_HIN": "<color=#F7BE45>[PARENT_CHARACTER1]</color> <color=#F7BE45>[CHARACTER_NAME]</color> की यात्रा में एक साथी के रूप में शामिल हो गया है!",
